  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><a id="balance" title="balance" href="#"></a>EAGLE BANCORP MONTANA, INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF FINANCIAL CONDITION</p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">(Dollars in Thousands, Except for Share Data)</p>
