   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">There was <ix:nonFraction id="c148437789" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromSaleOfAvailableForSaleSecuritiesDebt" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="-3">no</ix:nonFraction> sales activity for available-for-sale securities during the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> or <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30,&#160;</em><em style="font: inherit;">2026</em>&#160;or <em style="font: inherit;">2025.</em></span></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
