   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Included in the above are loans guaranteed by U.S. government agencies tota</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">ling </span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction id="c148438065" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis-CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMember_GuaranteeObligationsByNatureAxis-UnitedStatesDepartmentOfAgricultureRuralDevelopmentMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestBeforeAllowanceForCreditLoss" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">15,853,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">a</span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">n</span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">d </span></span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">$<ix:nonFraction id="c148438066" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_FinancingReceivablePortfolioSegmentAxis-CommercialRealEstatePortfolioSegmentMember_GuaranteeObligationsByNatureAxis-UnitedStatesDepartmentOfAgricultureRuralDevelopmentMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestBeforeAllowanceForCreditLoss" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">12,091,000</ix:nonFraction> at </span><em style="font: inherit