   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: center;">EAGLE BANCORP MONTANA, INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES<br/> NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS (UNAUDITED)</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size:10pt"><span style="background-color:#ffffff">NOTE <em style="font: inherit;">3.</em></span></span></b></span><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size:10pt"><span style="background-color:#ffffff">&#160;</span></span></span><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size:10pt"><span style="background-color:#ffffff">LOANS RECEIVABLE</span></span></b></span><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size:10pt"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"> &#8211; continued</span></span></b></span></p></ix:exclude><p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><b></b></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">The following table&#160;provides allowance for credit&#160;losses activity for the <em style="font: inherit;">six</em>&#160;months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>.</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
