   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size:10pt"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Interest income recognized on nonaccrual loans for the&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">three</em> and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em></span></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size:10pt"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;is considered insignificant.</span></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size:10pt"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;"> In</span></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size:10pt"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">terest payments received on a cash basis related to nonaccrual loans were $<ix:nonFraction id="c148438082" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="ebmt:InterestReceivedOnPastDueLoansAppliedToPrincipal" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">247,000</ix:nonFraction> a</span>t </span><em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size:10pt"> and&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c148438083" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="ebmt:InterestReceivedOnPastDueLoansAppliedToPrincipal" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">262,000</ix:nonFraction> at</span><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size:10pt">&#160;</span><em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size:10pt">.</span></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">The following tables present&#160;the amortized cost basis of collateral-dependent loans by class of loans and collateral type.</span></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
