   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: center;">EAGLE BANCORP MONTANA, INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES<br/> NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS (UNAUDITED)</p></ix:exclude><p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: center;"></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
  </ix:nonNumeric>
  <div>
    &#160;
  </div>
  <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:ComprehensiveIncomeNoteTextBlock" id="c3240882" escape="true">
   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><b><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">NOTE <em style="font: inherit;">7.</em> ACCUMULATED OTHER COMPREHENSIVE INCOME (LOSS)</span></b></span></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><b><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;</span></b></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">The following table includes information regarding the activity in accumulated other comprehensive income (loss).</p>
