es New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt;"><em style="font: inherit;">Total Fair</em></p> </td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td></tr>
