  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">Securities available-for-sale were <span style="background-color:#ffffff;">$285.68</span>&#160;million<span style="background-color:#ffffff;"> at </span>June 30, 2026<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">, an increase&#160;of $3.99&#160;million, or 1.4%,&#160;</span>from<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;</span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">$281.69&#160;m</span>illion at December 31, 2025. The increase&#160;was primarily due to purchasing activity of $15.19 million, which&#160;was partially offset by maturities, principal payments and call activity of $10.20&#160;million.&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
