  <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="color:#000000;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Deposits increased by $8.61&#160;million, or 0.5%, from&#160;</span></span>December 31, 2025<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;to&#160;</span>June 30, 2026<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">. Money market&#160;increased by $10.40&#160;million, time certificates of deposit&#160;increased by $5.26&#160;million and savings&#160;increased by $2.60&#160;million.&#160;These&#160;increases were partially offset by&#160;decreases in interest-bearing checking&#160;of $5.73&#160;million&#160;and noninterest checking of $3.92 million.</span></p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">The Bank's estimated amount of uninsured deposits was $359.82&#160;million, or 19.9%, of deposits&#160;including accrued interest&#160;at </span>June 30, 2026, compared<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;to&#160;$354.59 million, or 19.5%, at </span>December 31, 2025<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">.</span></p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;">The following table summarizes borrowing activity:</p>
