  <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Total borrowings increased&#160;by $14.14&#160;million, or 17.1%, to $96.61&#160;million at </span>June 30, 2026<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;from $82.47 million at </span>December 31, 2025<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">, due to an increase&#160;in FHLB advances and other borrowings.</span></p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><i><b><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Shareholders&#8217; Equity</span></b></i></p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Total shareholders&#8217; equity increased by $5.60&#160;million, or 2.9%, to $197.41&#160;million at </span>June 30, 2026<span style="background-color:#ffffff;"> from $191.81 million at </span>December 31, 2025<span style="background-color:#ffffff;">. The increase was primarily attributed to net income of $7.70&#160;million. The&#160;increase&#160;was partially&#160;offset by dividends paid of $2.31&#160;million and other comprehensive loss, net of tax of $462,000.</span></p>
  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
  <div class="PGBK" style="width: 100%; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt;">
