  <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color:#ffffff">The Bank's regulatory capital was&#160;in excess of all applicable regulatory requirements and the Bank is deemed "well capitalized" pursuant to State of Montana and FRB rules as of December 31, 2025</span><span style="background-color:#ffffff">. The Bank's actual capital amounts and ratios as of December 31, 2025&#160;</span><span style="background-color:#ffffff">are presented in the table below and all of the ratios, with the exception of the Tier 1 capital adjusted total average assets ratio, include the capital conservation buffer of 2.50%.&#160;</span></p>
