     <td style="width: 90%; vertical-align: top;"> <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"><b><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">Mine Safety Disclosures</span></b></p> </td>
