   <p style="margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt -1pt; text-align: justify;">During the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em>&#160;months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148440208"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148440209"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148440210"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c148440211">none</span></span></span></span> of our directors or officers (as defined in Exchange Act Rule <em style="font: inherit;">16a</em>-<em style="font: inherit;">1</em>(f)) adopted or terminated a &#8220;Rule <em style="font: inherit;">10b5</em>-<em style="font: inherit;">1</em> trading arrangement&#8221; or &#8220;non-Rule <em style="font: inherit;">10b5</em>-<em style="font: inherit;">1</em> trading arrangement,&#8221; as each term is defined in Item <em style="font: inherit;">408</em> of Regulation S-K.</p>
  </ix:nonNumeric>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
